from pathlib import Path
p=Path('AUDIT_REPORT.md');s=p.read_text(encoding='utf-8')
s=s.replace('- Citizen and field SOS now distinguish a saved report from a delivered alert. Server failures no longer return fake success IDs; field UI no longer substitutes Patna coordinates for a missing GPS fix or claims control-room notification. Direct emergency contact remains necessary until an actual dispatch transport is configured.','- Citizen and field SOS now distinguish a saved report from a delivered alert. Server failures no longer return fake success IDs; field UI no longer substitutes Patna coordinates for a missing GPS fix or claims control-room notification. The main public SOS modal submits rescue, medical and food/water reports to the server with a current or recent GPS fix, and reports failures instead of claiming help is on the way. Nova emergency detection opens that confirmation form rather than activating a fake dispatch. Direct emergency contact remains necessary until an actual dispatch transport is configured.\n- Removed the simulated live-GPS-sharing banner and false family-notification claims. The safe marker is explicitly local to the device. Public alerts and risk cards no longer silently display demo data as live when demo mode is off.')
s=s.replace('- The configured database did not connect during the live check. Database-dependent CRUD, RAG persistence, SOS report recording, actual shelter lists and realtime updates cannot be certified until a working database is supplied/reachable. No destructive schema changes were attempted.','- The configured database did not connect during the live check. Database-dependent CRUD, RAG persistence, SOS report recording, actual shelter lists and realtime updates cannot be certified until a working database is supplied/reachable. Local SOS requests consequently show a recording failure; that is intentional and safer than a false success. No destructive schema changes were attempted.')
s=s.replace('- Demo authentication remains enabled as requested. This is a demo session model, not production identity verification.','- Demo authentication remains enabled as requested. This is a demo session model, not production identity verification.\n- The PDF is a broad architecture/viva reference, not a complete executable specification. Some screens still use labeled illustrative data, and the emergency dispatch, continuous location sharing, real public alert feed and family messaging described there are not implemented end to end.')
p.write_text(s,encoding='utf-8')
